{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"plugins/claude-code/README.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-01T20:16:51.817575Z","id":"26ad92e2f70cf48a74bfddffabf91f2b6f3b396af45a159e947a85271080ca00","body":{"detail":"README.md:86-91 says each case that uses the shared fixture has its own copy of evals/_fixture/scaffold.sh, and the copies must be updated by hand after every edit. All 13 copies match today (`cmp` against _fixture/scaffold.sh; only no-qual-files differs, by design). However, scripts/test-plugin.sh never compares them. It runs _fixture/scaffold.sh directly at test-plugin.sh:1838, and runs per-case copies only for the 8 file-graded cases. A drifted copy in another case would silently seed an eval with a different fixture than the one the tests validate.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":86},"end":{"line":91},"content_hash":"294790e6cd010efe2f33878a5e5e58629ebb2885444fd66b6be9ba623c8de764"},"suggested_fix":"Add a check to scripts/test-plugin.sh: for every case whose case.yaml names `scaffold.sh` (except no-qual-files), `cmp -s` it against evals/_fixture/scaffold.sh, and fail naming the case on any difference.","summary":"Per-case scaffold.sh copies must be kept in sync with evals/_fixture/scaffold.sh by hand, and no check catches drift","tags":["review","review:2026-10-01","session:claude-code:906ddd45-2dc1-4a64-9674-56eec33bd6f1"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"plugins/claude-code/README.md","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-01T20:18:57.447017Z","id":"9ceb992f109302daeb3708a24abd21d4b139933b5650692aea7129d4c9ae175f","body":{"detail":"plugins/claude-code/README.md:86-91 describes copying the file by hand. Running `cmp -s <case>/scaffold.sh _fixture/scaffold.sh` over plugins/claude-code/evals/*/ shows all 13 copies identical and only no-qual-files different. `grep -n scaffold scripts/test-plugin.sh` finds no `cmp` of case copies against _fixture/scaffold.sh. The guard tests (1230-1321) and line 1838 run _fixture/scaffold.sh, and line 1907 runs per-case scripts only for a subset of cases.","kind":"comment","references":"26ad92e2f70cf48a74bfddffabf91f2b6f3b396af45a159e947a85271080ca00","summary":"confirmed: the per-case scaffold.sh copies are kept in sync by hand, and no check compares them","tags":["verified:confirmed","session:claude-code:906ddd45-2dc1-4a64-9674-56eec33bd6f1"]}}
